@startuml
actor Mantenedor
participant "README.md" as R
participant "PR / GitHub review" as PR
participant "main" as Main
participant "Perfil GitHub" as Profile
Mantenedor -> R : editar conteúdo e links
R -> PR : criar PR + validação visual
PR -> PR : verificar badges, imagens e URLs
PR -> Main : squash merge aprovado
Main -> Profile : renderizar README
Profile --> Mantenedor : checagem desktop/mobile
@enduml
